(87, 'Hello Team,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I wanted to provide some feedback on my decision to delete the app from my device. Although I appreciate the features and functionality your app offers, I\'ve encountered some issues that have affected my experience.\n\nFirstly, the app has been consuming a significant amount of battery life, causing my device to run out of power more quickly than usual. Additionally, I\'ve noticed frequent crashes and slow performance, which has made it challenging to use the app efficiently. \n\nMoreover, I\'ve found that some features, which I expected to be free, are locked behind a paywall. While I understand the need to monetize, this has made the app less useful for my needs. Lastly, the user interface could be more intuitive, as I\'ve struggled to navigate through some sections.\n\nI hope you find this feedback helpful. Thank you for your efforts in creating and maintaining the app, and I wish you all the best in future updates.\n\nBest regards,  ', '2024-08-26 18:29:26', '+22896557388', 'simpledeliverysolution@gmail.com'),
