y level must be “None” or “Low”.\r\n🔹 (Server settings > Security configuration > Verification level)\r\n\r\n4️⃣ Be careful not to ban members:\r\n\r\n🔹 Do not ban joining members during the process.\r\n🔹 Banning may interrupt the process.\r\n🔹 You can take any desired action once the order is complete.\r\n\r\n5️⃣ Create a permanent invitation link :\r\n\r\n🔹 Your invitation link must be unlimited.\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\n\r\n🔝 Quality: Good\r\n⚡ Speed: Fast\r\n♻️ Lifetime warranty\r\n📉 Loss rate: 0-5%\r\n🔗 Invitation link\r\n🔓 No protection', 12.92, 1000, 500, 1000, 1, 433, 7.776),
