(149, 1, 890, 'Eagles Express est une société de livraison de premier plan, prête à répondre à tous vos besoins de livraison. Notre équipe dévouée propose une gamme complète de services, allant de la livraison de colis à celle de repas, des courses en pharmacie au supermarché, ainsi que la prise en charge de vos documents administratifs et du pressing. Avec notre disponibilité aux numéros 94152474 et 47367805, nous sommes là pour rendre vos livraisons rapides, efficaces et sans tracas. Faites confiance à Eagles Express pour une expérience de livraison fiable et de qualité.', 'dressur_pro_1722556431.jpg', '2024-08-06 08:57:23', '2024-08-08 08:57:23', 4, 601, 'Gratuit', 913, 1, '[803,1082,782,841,2,997,780,785,1088,860,889,1089,1070,498,11,948,139,4,10,581,977,892,82,77,1092,3,861,908,812,968,564,1097,859,133,220,722,1100,184,990,642,751,535,1104,1005,1107,1015,897,242,366,596,436,239,1112,1114,748,132,877,910,904,849,858,1077,1125,1034,1006,740,1032,252,832,893,801,737,1141,894,1143,1037,705,321,805,122,713,757,1014,547,87,1152,1155,1057,46,822,825,842,371,974,775,987,868,810,754,750,268,952,687,1168,949,14,515,124,1171,962,808,1174,461,896,887,1177,978,98,1179,681,865,994,29,181,76,171,359,226,229,477,429,406,517,481,402,522,269,250,790,272,47,125,304,292,857,586,929,281,1180,43,1182,86,1184,1185,738,196,430,773,774,831,792,663,819,992,830,864,1187,753,1001,672,413,923,806,840,1188,1190,161,444,972,1192,1193,719,1194,1026,798,549,820,511,1195,234,845,667,1200,833,39,1201,71,980,957,655,148,912,1017,838,471,839,1205,1207,1208,492,1071,807,835,1209,1211,1212,102,1213,191,1214,895,401,1218,169,186,12,991,141,1219,1022,1220,658,53,484,1221,1008,419,1222,1223,770,166,1224,826,940,767,866,420,723,1225,93,595,1228,1229,142]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'produit_service'),
