(352, 1, 1826, 'Empire Mark Digital Group se spécialise dans la création de comptes TikTok monétisés depuis l\'Afrique. L\'entreprise utilise son expertise en marketing digital et en gestion des réseaux sociaux pour aider les particuliers et les entreprises à développer leur présence sur TikTok et à générer des revenus. Grâce à des stratégies sur mesure, le groupe s\'assure que les clients optimisent leur contenu pour favoriser l\'engagement, la visibilité et les opportunités de monétisation, tout en respectant les directives de TikTok. Ce service fait partie de leur offre plus large qui inclut la gestion de communauté, la création de contenu et la stratégie digitale sur diverses plateformes.\n\n', 'dressur_pro_1726310997.jpg', '2024-09-14 11:12:16', '2024-09-18 11:12:16', 4, 4043, 'Payant', 4717, 1, '[2243,2210,2241,2133,2239,2234,2242,2244,2238,2158,2245,2246,2203,2157,2225,4,2231,461,2237,2,2218,949,1589,2224,2181,2227,2247,2206,2207,3,2248,2249,2250,2251,2252,2146,2253,2254,2255,2186,890,2256,471,2257,2258,2259,12,1545,2260,1193,2261,2262,2170,169,2168,2183,1619,2263,2264,2265,2266,2267,2268,2269,1873,2163,2270,2271,1424,2166,2041,2213,2272,125,2273,2274,751,2275,2276,2277,1716,46,2197,2201,2217,2278,549,2123,2279,1965,2280,2179,2281,1485,1883,199,2136,2282,2283,2284,10,1308,1870,2285,2286,2287,2288,2289,1241,2088,227,2290,2291,2292,2293,2294,2295,2296,2297,436,242,2189,1731,720,150,2298,2299,2300,2301,2302,2303,2304,2305,2306,2307,2308,2309,2310,2311,2312,1958,2313,2314,2053,1268,2315,2316,2317,2318,2159,2319,2320,841,477,2321,2322,2323,2212,2324,122,2325,2326,1930,1852,2089,2328,2061,2101,2329,2330,2331,2332,1481,2333,2334,2335,2336,2337,2338,2339,1278,2340,98,2341,2342,2343,2344,2345,2346,2233,2347,2348,2349,2222,2350,2351,887,2352,2074,2353,277,1500,2354,2355,2356,2357,2358,2359,1938,2360,1829,1009,2361,1539,2362,2114,2363,1514,1219,1877,2364,2365,2366,2105,1342,63,2367,2368,2370,1222,2134,2180,2371,1335,2190,2220,1939,2372,1441,2373,87,1194,77,2374,2169,189