(374, 1, 1826, 'Empire Mark Digital Music inter est une division d\'Empire Mark Digital Business, spécialisée dans la promotion et la distribution de musique sur des plateformes internationales. Ce service permet aux artistes de rendre leur musique accessible sur des plateformes mondiales telles que YouTube, Audiomack, Facebook, Twitter, Google et TikTok. La division se concentre également sur les stratégies de monétisation de la musique, aidant les artistes à générer des revenus à partir de leur contenu numérique et à toucher un public plus large grâce à un marketing stratégique. En outre, ils proposent des formations pour les individus et les artistes sur la distribution musicale et la monétisation.\n\n', 'dressur_pro_1726395480.jpg', '2024-09-16 03:16:44', '2024-09-20 03:16:44', 4, 2271, 'Gratuit', 2703, 1, '[2157,2269,2397,2375,2398,2158,1222,484,841,2183,2133,2296,461,11,242,2399,1883,353,4,2109,2383,2396,2283,1278,2006,720,2134,2203,410,2374,2185,2370,1441,1870,2237,953,887,2388,1545,2206,2146,2400,1558,2260,2298,1538,2261,1539,1088,1195,832,2277,2373,1541,515,1852,748,2143,2291,2070,2402,2312,1481,1930,1483,436,2403,219,214,587,2404,2142,471,549,2252,2293,2405,2169,2159,1009,2367,2061,2406,2164,2279,2168,2181,534,2407,1965,2,2078,1844,1992,227,2325,2339,132,2318,3,2408,2287,2365,2409,1114,94,1901,2004,186,2271,2290,974,2412,2239,2273,304,2248,1308,904,2414,384,2180,1716,2415,2227,2416,1608,46,1514,2231,910,2417,2188,2105,2207,1174,825,2053,1938,1542,1850,681,2418,2363,810,2419,2360,2102,1411,2088,1194,329,2101,2089,1500,2041,1342,1032,2141,877,838,2329,890,2421,1219,1273,2166,642,805,2114,2352,949,2422,2171,2253,2386,1193,419,47,2292,1565,1112,2201,125,1572,1595,2303,2366,2423,10,2425,1829,1300,2426,2427,1241,2381,169,2289,1944,1628,1878,1599,798,2163,2429,2371,2224,1450,2431,858,1857,1466,228,455,785,2074,1575,2432,1458,2216,1589,2199,82,2390,2300,822,2433,1873,2058,2434,199,984,2435,2343,184,366,2436,269,775,98,2437,866,77,2028,1877,12,889,1895,2357,2438,26