(458, 4, 2393, 'Découvrez le mini fer à repasser à vapeur, votre allié idéal pour des vêtements impeccables en un rien de temps ! Compact et léger, il se glisse facilement dans un tiroir ou une valise, tout en offrant une performance remarquable. Grâce à sa fonction vapeur puissante, il élimine les plis tenaces et redonne vie à vos tissus. Parfait pour les voyages ou les petites retouches à la maison, il assure une expérience de repassage efficace et rapide. Son design ergonomique et sa facilité d\'utilisation en font un choix incontournable pour garder vos vêtements toujours au top.\r\nLivraison gratuite et paiement à la livraison  au Bénin \r\nNuméro : 54373734', 'dressur_pro_1727864596.jpg', '2024-10-02 15:15:28', '2024-10-30 15:15:28', 4, 4722, 'Gratuit', 5795, 1, '[1003,1818,2581,2561,2598,2554,1772,2358,2058,511,2597,2568,929,1883,436,785,714,413,2599,974,2485,2600,1369,1460,1514,2588,2473,242,1312,305,809,2596,1484,2010,858,2438,2180,3,10,2070,2601,102,1456,2586,2545,2512,2028,2574,1992,2602,718,1550,2061,1986,2361,1009,1342,1219,2559,2166,498,2560,1546,2,1572,1112,720,805,1222,77,1628,841,47,304,384,774,2603,810,2053,2604,268,515,1441,2371,1545,2029,2605,2373,1565,2038,2269,1762,549,1624,1241,2006,183,2440,2339,1942,2168,1947,2467,2587,186,2203,401,2606,1926,831,775,2571,1500,1944,2543,2386,1773,93,2607,2015,731,4,132,2018,838,2608,1895,1829,1505,163,98,861,734,812,949,2287,1916,2299,2208,1870,2536,1567,2041,2296,2074,1930,2594,587,2164,214,219,2496,1956,2497,2199,2181,82,1193,2399,1483,1396,71,1691,1791,2435,2210,1275,2609,1256,2610,2005,2611,2612,2576,2183,1185,1608,1574,410,1405,2396,2474,2163,477,117,2290,681,2378,1088,1952,2102,461,1939,2548,893,1536,250,534,783,1231,1826,2613,2570,146,2614,1750,46,705,1782,1642,272,1308,1985,1420,1699,748,1283,2503,2014,2284,2615,2616,2174,2527,2023,122,2540,2291,940,1032,608,2617,1589,2618,2280,402,2577,2410,2293,2408,2619,1383,890,2375,2279,1422,1844,1994,2298,2169,2620,2461,2088,766,1055,1966,2621,1931,1850,76,11,32