(667, 3, 3372, 'Sac à main élégant et tendance\n \nCe magnifique sac à main blanc cassé est parfait pour ajouter une touche de sophistication à votre style.  Fabriqué dans un matériau synthétique de haute qualité imitant le marbre, il présente un design élégant et intemporel. Sa forme structurée et ses détails dorés lui confèrent un aspect luxueux.  Il est suffisamment spacieux pour contenir vos essentiels quotidiens tout en restant compact et facile à transporter.  Ce sac est idéal pour le travail, les sorties ou les occasions spéciales.  Il est proposé à un prix exceptionnel de 4 500 Fcfa.  Ne manquez pas cette occasion !\nhttps://wa.me/2250170264898?text=Bonjour%20%20%F0%9F%91%8B%20', 'dressur_pro_1735817202.jpg', '2025-01-03 09:14:54', '2025-01-17 09:14:54', 4, 12184, 'Gratuit', 13749, 1, '[3,3365,2711,477,1628,1308,2607,1254,3055,2577,3034,2944,2637,2543,2750,2610,3122,20,77,2908,3264,1878,1773,87,3369,2006,858,228,655,3240,2833,2163,12,929,353,3223,3191,2868,3378,3379,2773,2596,1781,129,2497,3338,671,3366,2005,2855,3376,3380,3381,163,4,3359,47,2938,3004,17,3289,2755,3382,46,82,2,2658,1893,2180,3383,838,2649,2183,3070,3280,2941,275,3373,2169,3351,2358,3032,166,860,832,1939,3384,286,869,3385,1901,2937,2821,1212,2767,2018,3251,1169,3386,2438,3234,3367,1112,2840,2910,897,3140,2207,2810,240,3321,1505,3387,1107,2168,2746,2512,1032,1775,3180,2015,1514,23,3388,1193,2812,2896,2811,3389,2037,1686,3153,3073,3056,1636,1837,2786,3107,1938,2895,1772,3010,3208,366,3390,3105,2291,3339,1947,1654,2869,1008,3063,2058,3196,2599,3282,2864,849,2082,1173,2375,3304,1565,2800,2613,2611,3307,731,132,3225,183,3109,3174,402,3028,3166,3391,498,282,3058,2296,3392,515,2386,637,841,3393,2029,1352,419,3088,3394,3154,2940,2559,3281,534,3076,1926,2146,112,3395,3242,2825,125,30,2489,2776,2953,3396,3397,76,1017,3398,1383,93,3399,713,3400,3401,3402,3403,895,3404,3405,3406,3407,3408,3409,3410,3411,234,3412,3413,3414,3415,3416,3417,3418,3419,3108,3420,3421,3422,3423,3424,3425,3426,3427,3428,3429,343