(669, 1, 3354, 'Transformez chaque moment en une mélodie inoubliable ! 🎶\n\nÀ la recherche d\'un moyen unique et émouvant de célébrer un événement spécial ? Faites appel à nos services de personnalisation de chant pour créer des mélodies qui racontent votre histoire. Que ce soit pour un mariage, un anniversaire, une déclaration d\'amour ou un hommage, nous mettons notre créativité au service de vos émotions.\nChaque chanson est conçue spécialement pour vous, reflétant vos sentiments et vos souvenirs.', 'dressur_pro_1735853611.png', '2025-01-02 23:37:15', '2025-01-06 23:37:15', 4, 667, 'Gratuit', 843, 1, '[3,3136,3378,3064,3376,3298,268,1745,2906,2776,1514,2938,338,2750,53,897,3365,2711,477,1628,1308,2607,1254,3055,2577,3034,2944,2637,2543,2610,3122,20,77,2908,1878,1773,87,3369,2006,858,228,655,3240,2833,2163,12,929,353,3223,3191,2868,3379,2773,2596,1781,129,2497,3338,671,2005,2855,3380,3381,163,4,3359,47,3004,17,3289,2755,3382,46,82,2,2658,1893,2180,3383,838,2649,2183,3070,3280,2941,275,3373,2169,3351,2358,3032,166,860,832,1939,3384,286,869,3385,1901,2937,2821,1212,2767,2018,3251,1169,3386,2438,3234,3367,1112,2840,2910,3140,2207,2810,240,3321,1505,3387,1107,2168,2746,2512,1032,1775,3180,2015,23,3388,1193,2812,2896,2811,3389,2037,1686,3153,3073,3056,1636,1837,2786,3107,1938,2895,1772,3010,3208,366,3105,2291,3339,1947,1654,2869,1008,3063,2058,3196,2599,3282,2864,849,2082,2375,3304,1565,2800,2613,2611,3307,132,183]', '', 0, 0, 'N;', 'produit_service'),
