(900, 1, 4339, '✨ Découvrez les bienfaits du Savon Noir Longrich ! ✨\r\nUn savon pas comme les autres, conçu pour une peau éclatante et en pleine santé ! Voici pourquoi vous allez l’adorer :\r\n\r\n✔ Nettoie en profondeur : élimine impuretés et excès de sébum\r\n✔ Éclaircit le teint : unifie la peau et réduit les taches\r\n✔ Hydrate et nourrit : pour une peau douce et éclatante\r\n✔ Anti-bactérien et anti-inflammatoire : combat boutons et irritations\r\n✔ Exfolie en douceur : élimine les cellules mortes et affine le grain de peau\r\n\r\nOffrez à votre peau le soin qu’elle mérite ! Commandez dès maintenant et profitez d’une peau radieuse au quotidien.', 'dressur_pro_1739183966.jpg', '2025-02-10 20:51:15', '2025-02-14 20:51:15', 4, 1191, 'Gratuit', 1440, 1, '[3,3580,4279,4124,4265,4360,4334,4299,4308,4131,4274,3777,2756,82,4353,1171,3776,3918,4031,3466,4251,3886,4209,4077,3504,4178,366,3698,1219,3851,4288,2599,199,4246,2607,4059,4314,897,2937,3234,4242,4123,3632,2358,122,4310,2,4323,4320,4232,4,4304,3454,3359,4100,3831,1308,3084,3963,3095,4206,164,3998,4273,4075,3959,4199,3499,4363,3109,4241,2812,4165,4344,782,4135,542,1545,2955,2231,1500,3996,4261,3696,2908,3199,4348,2146,4175,2944,4102,4364,3949,2005,3794,4227,268,3614,1032,53,4163,3756,4149,4103,4365,4225,4218,2074,3665,4366,3773,4072,4289,4367,4328,1938,4321,1883,4368,3775,1514,2864,4369,4282,4312,4154,4101,4271,451,2015,4370,4296,4371,4148,4003,3888,2393,308,4198,1070,4080,3208,2006,4341,4329,4029,461,4196,2058,4184,3373,3693,3673,2886,2180,1441,3731,4373,477,3898,1420,413,3843,2810,2470,4374,4104,2018,4147,4269,4025,889,4343,3392,2773,4375,4158,663,2868,240,2811,4211,3376,1862,46,3557,3585,3508,4050,4181,3718,3321,2895,4106,3421,3338,1901,3070,776,4297,748,4129,2800,838,4377,2929,141,3173,498,832,4378,3938,2941,228,4355,2181,3635,3319,3028,129,2296,1422,4379,2168,2543,2637,3010,1750,2827,4359,3410,4380,942,4055,4222,3534,1543,4381,4356,1939,4084,1112,3391,3223,3720,3108,3133,517,3649,4247,3166,1877,1574,3127,457