(943, 1, 4577, 'Farine de Cossette d\'igname authentique. \nL\'emballage d\'un kilogramme coût 1200 franc CFA et celui de 600g(équivalent du tongolo) coût 800 franc CFA. \nCette farine est non seulement utilisé pour faire de la pâte noir mais aussi elle est utilisée pour la préparation du wassa-wassa et du toubani. \nElle est très recommandée pour ces vertus diététiques, elle permet de contrôler le taux d\'insuline et des concentrations du glucose. \nLa farine de Cossette d\'igname est l\'idéal pour les personnes diabétiques et ceux qui souhaitent contrôler leurs poids. ', 'dressur_pro_1740401819.jpg', '2025-02-25 14:45:16', '2025-03-03 14:45:16', 4, 6345, 'Gratuit', 7039, 1, '[4686,4725,129,3012,4628,4724,4722,4726,4719,4714,4654,4668,4548,4709,4723,4713,2512,4673,4534,4381,4484,4,4718,4570,4530,4186,4327,4653,4727,4536,4487,4716,3580,4728,4715,4485,3,3055,4576,4553,4729,4623,4495,4674,4647,4613,4730,3831,4731,4732,4733,3086,4550,4508,4443,4592,4734,4735,4660,4261,3199,4533,4488,4496,4736,4737,3886,4507,4163,4584,4455,4738,4739,2203,2908,4583,4601,4632,4551,4712,2438,4740,4467,4652,4691,4602,929,4661,4741,785,832,199,2599,4742,4743,4744,4573,2886,4745,4746,4651,4489,4748,4749,2393,4750,4751,3838,4497,4752,4753,3561,4501,4483,4535,4544,4754,4706,4755,4756,4606,4757,4758,4759,4760,2,4526,4761,4762,82,4646,4410,4310,4763,4664,4764,4765,4766,4129,3109,4767,4768,4769,4401,4672,4525,4770,4771,4772,4773,4559,4603,4503,4405,4774,4775,819,4776,4446,4777,4778,4695,4779,4571,4780,4781,4782,4637,4783,4784,1870,4620,4785,4786,4476,4787,4696,4667,4380,4788,132,4435,4582,4597,3739,4789,4790,4791,4075,4792,4569,4285,3375,4793,4794,4688,4698,4795,4387,4624,4796,4797,4440,461,4798,3725,4799,4800,4801,4681,4703,1893,4493,4124,4802,3724,4803,4804,4805,4806,942,1112,4807,4808,4676,4809,4636,3775,3143,4810,4811,4812,4178,4539,4241,4813,2895,2944,3376,4814,2180,4815,4816,889,4492,1750,3949,4817,4599,2666,2058,4218,4633,4635,3131,3234,4819,4820,4821,4822,4823,4824,4825,87,4630,4206,4359,4