(956, 1, 4599, '\n✨ L’Art du Parfum : Une Signature Unique ✨\n\nUn parfum, c’est bien plus qu’une simple fragrance… C’est une empreinte, une émotion, une histoire à raconter. 🌸🌿💫\n\nDécouvrez notre collection exquise, où chaque note est une invitation au voyage :\n💎 Notes florales pour une touche de douceur et d’élégance\n🌿 Accords boisés pour une profondeur envoûtante\n🍊 Éclats d’agrumes pour une fraîcheur pétillante\n\nLaissez votre parfum parler pour vous… Quelle sera votre signature olfactive ? 🌹✨\n\n📍 Disponible dès maintenant en boutique et en ligne..\n\n', 'dressur_pro_1740437403.jpg', '2025-02-25 05:29:29', '2025-03-03 05:29:29', 4, 7153, 'Gratuit', 7951, 1, '[4612,3,4380,4408,4498,4601,4484,4452,4508,3831,4597,4553,4606,4501,4613,4510,4483,4495,4440,4497,4614,4592,4535,4184,4032,4583,2018,53,4615,751,4616,4617,4618,4619,2,1401,4620,4621,4622,4623,4584,4624,4625,4626,4627,3699,4628,4629,4630,4631,4544,3580,4632,4503,4633,4301,4129,4634,4444,4635,4636,4637,4526,4638,4639,4640,4641,4642,4381,1545,4643,4644,4645,4646,4647,4536,4648,3389,4329,4603,4649,4650,4580,4401,4473,3375,4525,4651,4652,4653,4654,4655,4487,3649,4577,4656,4657,4518,4570,4658,4506,4659,2908,2358,4529,2607,4660,4661,4410,4662,3021,4519,4582,4551,4663,4664,4533,4665,4666,383,3851,4667,471,4668,4576,4669,4546,957,1589,4670,4671,4672,4489,1961,4673,4674,4131,4451,4675,4676,3525,4677,4678,4075,4679,2203,4680,3199,4571,4569,4681,4682,3635,4683,4684,3886,4685,3071,4686,2284,4687,4688,4689,4690,4538,4691,3361,2864,4692,4693,4694,4405,4474,4695,4461,3594,4696,4697,4698,4261,4578,4407,4699,4377,4435,4700,4701,4703,1441,4704,4705,4706,4707,4455,3776,3996,4400,4422,2512,3945,4709,4186,4710,4711,4712,2053,4713,4714,4715,1514,4716,4717,132,4534,3981,4718,4509,1500,4500,3892,4719,4720,4721,4722,4723,4,4724,4725,3012,129,4726,4548,4530,4327,4727,4728,4485,3055,4729,4730,4731,4732,4733,3086,4550,4443,4734,4735,4488,4496,4736,4737,4507,4163,4738,4739,2438,4740,4467,4602,929,4741,785,832,199,2599,4742,4743,4744