(1014, 2, 1545, '🌿 CleanShield – Votre allié santé au quotidien !\n\nPurifiez votre sang et protégez votre corps avec CleanShield ! Ce puissant antioxydant élimine toxines, cholestérol, acide urique et graisses pour un organisme plus sain et équilibré.\n\nLuttez naturellement contre l’hypertension, le diabète et l’obésité tout en prenant soin de votre foie et de vos reins. CleanShield, c’est l’assurance d’une meilleure santé, jour après jour !\n\nCommandez maintenant et ressentez la différence ! 💚', 'dressur_pro_1740914178.jpg', '2025-03-02 14:27:51', '2025-03-14 14:27:51', 4, 11236, 'Gratuit', 12658, 1, '[655,4518,4959,3167,4583,3154,3831,4960,4572,4942,4891,4937,4882,4961,4401,4952,4958,841,4576,2908,4538,199,4701,4256,4950,2607,4957,308,3776,4571,3825,4553,3214,3665,4962,4963,4866,4896,1171,4964,3051,4407,820,3199,3580,4931,3852,4945,4953,4381,4832,4505,77,1254,4622,785,3996,3435,4878,4241,4444,4774,4689,2497,4199,4490,4965,4129,132,4369,4405,4535,366,4492,4928,4913,4826,3436,4484,1514,164,2070,275,4966,4899,4865,3391,4667,3698,53,4332,4820,3720,4711,4668,4131,4902,3635,4714,4435,4849,2296,4927,4314,163,3993,4908,4548,3155,4731,4054,4851,4472,4526,4506,3759,4440,3056,4602,3055,82,2180,4421,4967,4584,4674,4868,3319,4954,4077,4760,4968,1644,2812,4897,2203,4969,4951,3918,3700,4126,4432,3892,4242,4288,4623,3095,3433,1032,3376,4353,4970,4400,4971,3359,4972,4406,2018,4852,4546,4973,2839,4102,4394,4946,2146,4196,4974,2890,4823,4025,4075,3454,1770,4975,4558,4261,4889,4083,4410,4976,1862,4,2058,3718,2944,4473,3,2,3365,2825,3414,2358,4977,4006,3913,4978,4364,444,228,4570,1926,1411,3886,3556,4906,4936,4979,4651,832,984,3669,413,3972,4124,3674,141,4479,4298,4624,4980,4691,2773,3500,889,4503,2937,3888,4956,4981,4735,1420,4539,751,280,4123,3375,4165,186,4982,4310,4804,4983,3389,4984,4985,3109,4279,4712,4986,4987,4218,2005,4550,1826,4988,4989,2543,102,4990,4227,4422,3258,4991,4992,4578,4501,2393,4380,2512,4632,4469,4993,1543,3932,4782,4786,4994,4696,477,4508,4374,4654,822,4938,