(1027, 1, 4899, 'FORMATION : ÉLEVAGE DES ESCARGOTS\n\n❓Savez-vous reconnaître par exemple, quand vos escargots manques de calcium, de la vitamine A ou D pour leurs croissances et comment combler ces besoins ? \n\n🔑Donnez vous les moyens de réussir l\'élevage des escargots.\n\n💠Tout le savoir nécessaire pour planifier votre production, concevoir les enclos, formuler des alimentations adéquate à vos escargots.\n\n✅Apprenez à fabriquer puis utiliser les intrants d\'élevage ( Provende, Pierre à lécher, Produit d\'entretien,...) pour une reproduction régulièrement et une croissance rapide.\n\n❌Évitez le piège des installations coûteuses et inefficace.\n\n Inscrivez vous dès maintenant et commencez votre formation\n\n+229 01 64 30 95 56', 'dressur_pro_1741209096.jpg', '2025-03-06 11:12:31', '2025-03-12 11:12:31', 4, 7125, 'Gratuit', 8000, 1, '[4621,4435,4440,3776,4868,4381,4630,5015,5007,3500,2937,199,268,4691,2908,4380,4337,5012,4261,4126,5016,46,4485,4686,4965,4400,328,2,4584,4553,5020,4484,87,5021,2512,4314,5019,4570,2183,5002,4927,5022,2082,4977,3199,2018,5018,5003,4976,4178,2944,4443,4845,4318,3587,4518,4852,3389,4797,2906,3159,4832,4953,4241,4165,4758,4218,132,2393,4395,4956,3720,4889,77,2181,5011,4547,4960,4989,3913,4576,4993,3949,4628,4935,4242,4906,4936,4405,4497,4878,4902,4811,1773,4674,4882,1770,3109,3470,841,4387,3307,228,4966,2886,4870,3852,889,3154,3831,4760,2777,82,3996,53,4077,4000,2895,2608,4211,4950,4592,2159,4995,4971,3993,4994,3693,4942,4597,832,4279,4833,3084,4949,4842,3886,2750,1301,2607,5023,515,3580,5025,3698,93,33,4327,1772,4536,785,1545,4,4467,5026,4632,4508,3825,4654,5027,3242,5028,3490,4509,2380,477,4622,4991,4711,4401,4908,1514,4770,3214,4709,4301,4713,461,4601,528,4776,5029,4455,4548,5030,4849,3635,1500,163,2497,2053,5006,4667,4501,4505,102,534,2864,5031,2284,305,2559,4017,3988,4940,4988,2296,3095,157,3376,4635,3632,2180,3651,4958,5032,4996,4653,4035,4551,3644,2058,4397,4431,4256,5033,4289,4822,3234,5013,4083,2005,2114,3773,1750,2941,4992,496