(1078, 1, 5163, '**Rejoignez AJS FORMATION : Maîtrisez Photoshop, PowerPoint et bien d\'autres !**\n\nVous souhaitez prendre votre vie en main et booster vos compétences professionnelles ? AJS FORMATION vous propose une formation pratique en ligne sur Photoshop, PowerPoint et bien d\'autres formations donnant droit à une attestation de fin de formation ! \n\nApprenez à créer des conceptions graphiques, des affiches, des logos, des cartes de visite et bien plus encore. Devenez un expert et ouvrez-vous à de nouvelles opportunités professionnelles tout en contribuant à la lutte contre le chômage à travers le monde.\n\nNe manquez pas cette chance de transformer vos compétences ! \n\n👉 Rejoignez-nous dès maintenant via le lien https://chat.whatsapp.com/JHtHhcehXKu5BeLPJxfe9J\n\nFaites le premier pas vers votre avenir !', 'dressur_pro_1741688469.jpg', '2025-03-11 11:11:21', '2025-03-17 11:11:21', 4, 5242, 'Gratuit', 5912, 1, '[5390,5088,5378,5381,3,4553,5043,5261,5367,5391,5079,5223,5062,199,2,5137,5385,5320,5352,5145,5105,5292,5321,5349,4614,5049,5205,5089,498,5151,4870,5317,4310,3913,5068,5101,5362,2005,5303,5126,5338,4913,5296,5210,3077,5119,5166,1672,5314,5253,5232,5382,5313,5106,4966,5388,3831,5156,4186,5341,5392,5239,5294,5306,4731,4896,5393,5251,5283,5308,3674,4942,5217,4711,5394,5090,5147,5040,5344,4572,1771,5030,5347,5268,4165,2940,4381,5316,2944,4991,534,5395,2607,5227,4405,5271,3776,5273,5345,5396,4274,5245,5397,5398,5133,214,5142,4131,219,4484,5276,163,4949,5201,5012,82,5076,5212,5375,5399,4422,5400,5401,3282,4825,5077,5295,4832,4994,1938,5336,4551,5337,5290,5131,5384,5402,3580,5150,2029,5403,132,5244,4451,5269,1112,3199,1032,4679,5000,5259,461,5208,5229,4533,5404,5298,5053,3389,2919,2146,4976,5405,3775,4996,5066,268,4054,4760,5348,4578,4518,5199,5192,3886,4369,4902,4242,5250,5328,5406,5407,4936,4906,5408,4435,3918,4628,5272,5264,5258,2864,5323,4353,4,3932,4889,3122,5162,3731,4124,5409,609,5410,5246,5411,5082,5025,5412,3507,5241,5312,841,4956,5100,5413,5414,53