(1232, 1, 5833, 'Faites la différence avec mes créations uniques et faites main !\nJe vous propose :\n\nDes boucles d’oreilles, chaussures et sacs en pagne pour sublimer votre style avec une touche africaine authentique.\n\nDes coques de téléphone personnalisées avec strass, pour que votre téléphone brille autant que vous.\n\n\nChaque pièce est faite avec soin, amour et créativité.\nCommandes personnalisées possibles selon vos goûts et vos couleurs préférées.\n\nContactez-moi pour donner vie à votre élégance !', 'dressur_pro_1746612186.jpg', '2025-05-07 11:12:27', '2025-05-13 11:12:27', 4, 4648, 'Gratuit', 5218, 1, '[5889,5891,4,5892,5890,5875,5893,5826,5867,5894,5895,5896,5897,5898,5899,5900,5901,5841,5902,5888,4875,5903,5904,5872,5905,5906,5885,5907,5880,5908,5865,5861,5909,5910,5869,5868,5854,5911,5912,5913,5914,5915,5876,5916,5917,5918,5919,5920,199,2599,5922,5754,5923,5924,5925,5926,3776,5927,5928,5929,5930,5931,5932,5790,5830,5859,5834,5933,5934,5064,2637,5851,5815,5935,5779,5644,5883,5936,5937,5831,5938,5791,5939,5941,5942,5943,3635,5944,5945,869,5946,4691,5947,5948,5949,5950,4899,5747,5951,5808,5669,5952,5953,5954,5955,5620,4422,5956,5957,5958,2,5959,5960,5961,5962,5963,5964,5965,5381,5855,5966,4500,2524,5967,5968,2082,5969,5970,5971,5972,5973,4150,5974,5975,5500,5658,5976,5604,5977,5978,5979,5661,5980,5785,5981,5982,5983,5984,3520,3090,5844,5271,4776,5396,5986,5987,2061,5988,5989,5738,5990,3696,5991,1939,4627,5720,5992,5993,5994,5863,5995,5996,5997,5998,5999,4489,5624,6000,6001,6002,6003,3596,6004,6005,6006,3321,6007,3028,4032,6008,6009,1112,6010,6011,6012,6013,6014,6015,5858,4557,5864,5002,6016,6017,2837,6018,5803,6019,3084,6020,6021,6022,6023,6024,6025,6026,5847,6027,6028,2230,6029,6030,6031,6032,6033,5887,6034,6035,5628,6036,6038,6039,6040,6041,5823,3377,2965,6042,6043,6044,2944,6045,5796,6046,5306,4966,6047,6048,2053,2496,5662,6049,6050,6051,1219,6052,5726,5107,6053,2180,4935,6054,2497,6055,6056,6057,6058,6059,6060,3632,6061,6062,833,5402,3064,6063,6064