(1241, 1, 5872, 'Vous êtes actuellement à l\'étranger (France, USA, Allemagne, etc.) et souhaitez confier vos projets à un professionnel compétent. Nous sommes spécialisés dans la menuiserie en aluminium, et nous pouvons répondre à vos besoins en matière de :\n\n- Fabrication de fenêtres coulissantes\n- Cadres et châssis pour vitrages\n- Grilles anti-vol\n- Portes à la française et italiennes\n- Murs rideaux en aluminium et vitrages\n\nUn seul contact pour l\'ensemble de vos travaux, garantissant votre satisfaction.\n\nPour toute demande, veuillez-nous contacter à l’adresse suivante : sodjiisaaco@gmail.com ou par WhatsApp au +002290167848709. Vous pouvez également nous joindre au numéro suivant', 'dressur_pro_1746695101.jpg', '2025-05-08 19:33:44', '2025-05-14 19:33:44', 4, 2552, 'Gratuit', 2929, 1, '[5662,6088,5926,6051,6098,5990,5983,6096,5976,6087,6057,308,6099,5180,5766,5979,5863,5957,5738,5754,6039,5981,6021,6100,5804,6070,6101,2203,5864,5905,6074,5628,6022,5624,5815,5779,5119,6083,5831,4241,2812,5587,5830,6093,5834,6064,5306,6080,6102,6053,5884,5826,5785,5974,6008,5875,5908,5717,6089,5107,6061,6048,5413,5833,5253,5658,6047,4882,5844,6084,6028,6103,5854,365,5840,4864,6104,6011,5876,6054,6106,6107,6097,5950,5944,5791,4942,6108,3208,4435,5972,5900,6012,5932,6109,5937,6073,6111,5847,5978,4896,4242,4163,3319,4571,3095,5952,4,5941,1893,798,5948,5851,6112,5945,6013,2114,5820,4129,4551,4530,6113,4832,3090,5960,5959,1500,4570,2053,6078,5980,5126,5406,3,6056,748,6115,2543,3028,5858,6004,5942,5961,5745,6116,6067,5473,5590,6034,6063,4823,5697,4409,5457,2750,199,2599,2029,5246,5553,5975,6077,5835,5040,5859,5396,838,6118,2607,6119,2183,4994,3718,5967,5271,5994,5696,6120,6023,5992,4621,2180,82,6121,129,4870,5954,4991,5684,6122,6123,5641,5601,6050,5726,6046,6124,3517,2,5078,6125,5890,4032,6126,5869,3831,6071,4931,5843,4205,6127,5593,3632,718,6128,5381,6043,515,5210,904,3391,5661,5748,5984,6129,4837,5776,5537,5089,3408,3109,5606,5880,5734,5720,5861,6130,214,219,5133,4804,2163,