(1263, 1, 6012, 'Les besoins de ménage  auxquels nous répondons\n\nL\'intervention d\'une femme de ménage à domicile peut se faire sous différentes formes pour répondre à votre besoin.\n\nVoici la liste des prestations que nous pouvons offrir partout au Bénin\n\n👉 Ménage régulier \n👉 Ménage occasionnel / par weekend \n👉 Entretien -nettoyage general \n👉 Ménage pour personnes âgées\n👉 Lessive et repassage à domicile \n👉 Grand ménage et entretien général ..\n\n💫WISTON SERVICES 💫 VOTRE PARTENAIRE QUOTIDIEN \n\n📍 Nous sommes situés à sainte Rita rue collège la colombe \n\n☎️(+229) 01 40 15 36 01 \n\nWiston Services 👉 https://wa.me/22940153601', 'dressur_pro_1746831083.jpg', '2025-06-14 11:50:10', '2025-06-20 11:50:10', 4, 2696, 'Gratuit', 3304, 1, '[5119,3,5754,6133,3776,5831,5957,5738,6115,6130,6074,5861,5717,5919,5976,6119,5872,6088,5078,6057,199,6129,5720,6039,5932,2607,5246,5937,6053,5984,4931,5960,1112,2053,4356,5233,5967,5826,5662,6048,6022,6127,46,4,3831,2,6098,281,5948,6061,5244,6134,6135,5983,5381,5833,2497,5864,6073,3408,5175,4832,3972,5859,2203,5884,6070,6137,5974,5542,5944,6014,1505,3718,3146,4409,4991,4327,6138,5894,5769,5875,1879,5407,5358,6102,5876,5848,6139,6132,4571,6054,3028,6084,5696,620,1514,5844,5834,275,6047,4674,2320,6140,4942,5962,5959,5748,6118,5868,5843,6063,5396,5981,6123,6141,5163,82,5972,6142,6011,4032,802,5905,5926,5979,6008,3452,6023,2944,4701,5413,5830,3208,5726,1565,5820,6143,5854,904,5942,6043,5753,5728,6083,445,6122,6144,5952,5950,6145,4314,5804,6080,4582,5776,5961,6146,365,4206,4359,6147,5658,5402,5771,6148,5842,5107,3061,2183,6101,6064,5867,6055,6149,4394,6150,3696,5271,477,6152,3410,6153,6154,6155,5404,6156,5306,718,6087,3127,5785,748,5779,5636,4165,5590,4823,2325,4687,4968,5890,3321,1572,5494,6157,3508,2018,5767,4882,798,6158,3580,4526,5847,3773,5002,2296,6056,6159,3109,6160,6027,5789,5734,5736,4731,866,498,3614,5954,5512,2571,5213,4435,4489,4960,5628,2318,4405,2649,6161,3651,5969,4546,5484,6162,5114,3454,5564,3319,6163,5741,1862,38