(1332, 1, 6276, '🎧✨ Écouteur de Luxe Q26\n\nProfitez d’un son clair et puissant avec ces écouteurs haut de gamme au design moderne et confortable. Idéal pour vos appels, musiques et vidéos en toute liberté.\n\n🔥 Caractéristiques :\n✅ Autonomie longue durée – jusqu’à 8h d’écoute continue\n✅ Boîte de charge avec affichage digital\n✅ Design élégant et tendance (or, argent, noir)\n✅ Confortable, ne fait pas mal aux oreilles\n✅ Connexion Bluetooth stable et rapide\n✅ Micro intégré pour des appels clairs\n\n🚚 Livraison rapide disponible\n📞 Contact / WhatsApp : 01 97 04 49 75', 'dressur_pro_1757057875.jpg', '2025-09-05 09:33:18', '2025-09-11 09:33:18', 4, 5022, 'Gratuit', 5636, 1, '[3,5119,5402,6650,6447,4553,6115,6654,6412,6616,6655,1782,6506,5831,3831,4607,6597,5771,6658,6659,4787,5956,6577,6557,3725,3641,3848,6656,3335,6032,1547,4,6469,5864,6649,365,5944,141,5002,5406,6327,6573,3895,6660,5100,5505,6558,2543,139,91,1837,5123,4165,6316,6576,5053,5019,6555,5753,5137,6661,3698,4823,4935,166,6651,4774,4380,5872,4661,6170,6271,5954,6662,5089,4083,6365,5974,2,59,1500,4991,6556,802,6582,2787,6360,6358,4131,6240,4141,5624,5747,2940,6663,4242,5343,5088,3614,275,3596,205,4031,5471,3566,4728,3432,3674,6210,6236,3088,2944,2269,5673,5521,3493,450,3359,6500,3039,4241,6664,6665,6666,5750,6667,5952,5578,5043,3051,6668,6669,534,798,6670,6671,6672,6673,6674,1574,3651,2058,392,1938,1424,6675,6676,6622,6677,6678,6113,6679,6680,6681,6682,6684,6685,6686,6687,5981,2916,6688,6689,6690,3263,6691,410,4135,6692,1112,6693,6694,6695,713,6696,2325,6697,6698,4329,6699,6701,3455,3238,6703,4942,6704,4050,6705,6706,6707,5210,6630,6708,6709,3370,6710,6711,6712,6713,6714,5999,4936,6715,6716,6717,6718,6215,6719,6720,4899,4116,6721,3635,1876,5879,6722,6724,1628,6725,6726,3034,6727,4535,6728,6729,5511,1505,2284,6730,6542,6731,6619,6732,6733,6734,2750,6735,6736,6737,974,6738,6419,6739,6740,6741,6640,6742,6743,6744,6745,2666,6746,2955,6307,304,6570,129,66,6747,6470,6749,6750,6751,6752,3158,6753,6754,6488,6755,6