(1424, 2, 5193, 'NAPPY+ n’est pas un simple gel coiffant…\nC’est une révolution capillaire pour toutes celles qui veulent sublimer leurs cheveux crépus au naturel.\n\n👉 Résultats immédiats :\n✔ Boucles et twists parfaitement définis\n✔ Zéro résidu blanc, zéro effet carton\n✔ Hydratation intense grâce à l’aloe vera & glycérine végétale\n✔ Fixation souple idéale pour twists, baby hairs et afro puff\n✔ Brillance naturelle et douce au toucher\n\n🌍 Fabriqué avec soin par PRINFRIED, au Bénin 🇧🇯,\nNAPPY+ est spécialement conçu pour respecter la force et la beauté des cheveux crépus.\n\n💬 Parce que tes cheveux méritent le meilleur, choisis NAPPY+ – La fierté crépue, douce et stylée.', 'dressur_pro_1757619074.png', '2025-09-12 05:51:42', '2025-09-24 05:51:42', 4, 3437, 'Gratuit', 3989, 1, '[3,5726,6026,4991,6616,4936,5246,6975,6878,6477,6447,2940,2,4369,3886,1112,6684,6981,6533,6738,6556,6743,6987,5683,6861,6845,6817,6777,6852,6778,6881,7013,6360,4855,6983,6576,6809,6555,3051,5137,6115,6967,7014,4241,6923,6875,6758,5753,6412,4242,6416,6824,4,6765,7017,6605,6690,6669,7018,6894,39,6811,6859,6863,2571,6905,6592,6933,5779,7020,5864,6874,6740,3263,7008,6944,1608,1823,6630,3635,832,5872,6891,5402,365,6498,6679,6705,7023,6766,6538,5624,4135,4131,6468,6659,6488,4435,5100,6842,6421,6680,5908,6165,6735,5119,6884,6994,6799,5980,7000,6996,6838,5944,7027,6929,1883,6473,129,6880,7028,6938,7029,6966,5974,6236,91,3143,6470,3972,5491,6762,6619,4116,6573,5068,7030,7031,7032,6491,7033,1195,748,5237,6769,6695,6772,5520,6713,3848,6469,4050,6851,2284,6739,4811,2023,5831,6831,4607,504,513,509,6675,7037,2203,4774,4582,2396,4942,3614,461,3651,6640,6728,5604,6873,6697,7038,2607,4306,5789,798,2496,5644,6708,5088,6729,7039,1628,82,6304,4031,6688,7040,3432,7041,3208,5621,7042,2787,6365,5662,3596,1543,6582,2180,4318,6746,6160,7010,6760,6649,5484,6849,450,3028,2696,534,6664,6807,7044,6276,6529,5848,4731,6764,6829,7045,6776,6452,3370,5239,3319,4380,6039,7005,7047,7048,4329,559,7049,5306,713,6551,7050,4196,