(1525, 1, 7215, '📚 Pas le temps ou l’envie de lire ? Passez à l’audio.\nBeaucoup adorent les bonnes histoires mais n’arrivent pas à tenir un livre en main : fatigue, emploi du temps chargé, manque de concentration… C’est exactement pour ça que la version audio de La Formule de Dieu est idéale.\n\n🎧 Écoutez au lieu de lire :\n• Pendant vos trajets, en faisant du sport ou en vous détendant\n• Sans forcer les yeux ni tourner une page\n• Avec une narration prenante qui vous plonge directement dans l’ambiance\n\nVous profitez du suspense, des émotions et de l’intelligence du roman… sans avoir à lire une seule ligne.\nLa solution parfaite pour ceux qui aiment les histoires mais pas les pavés. \n\n', 'dressur_pro_1759440449.jpg', '2025-10-02 21:41:45', '2025-10-08 21:41:45', 4, 1651, 'Gratuit', 2069, 1, '[7116,7320,1608,7131,7323,7285,6891,7130,7147,7287,7321,2058,7084,7100,6807,7258,7249,7262,280,4701,1628,7104,6304,7311,6452,7324,6713,7154,7121,7325,7205,7085,6975,7150,7257,7271,3263,7213,7202,87,5212,3319,5683,1500,6616,6825,2940,6473,7326,798,7322,7263,82,6640,7073,7080,3028,7327,7307,6360,3831,7200,5402,365,7314,7304,6501,2896,7148,6772,6690,7140,5974,5119,5511,6866,3,2380,228,6705,2,6447,6878,6983,4535,7328,7329,7227,2696,7097,4116,534,6963,7091,4570,7151,6817,7277,5872,4131,7315,125,7317,5760,4553,7294,6830,5753,7330,1493,6576,7166,2358,7268,7165,6965,1679,7049,6327,7125,7231,7040,3810,7331,7279,410,4380,6542,6938,6296,3034,6680,5944,5098,7074,4196,4432,4900,6573,3391,5471,7184,2745,5128,1782,4050,4267,7332,7274,6412,5848,6476,6649,6252,838,7333,7334,5864,4882,6533,5043,5019,7335,6143,3454,6864,2181,13,6431,7336,3143,6994,5246,129,7010,6622,2711,7203,7337,5783,5137,5908,1112,4942,4242,7338,5002,6358,2180,2415,6836,6028,6421,7339,7102,2577,4936,5089,5520,7159,7093,6582,3848,7340,7341,7222,4950,6659,6420,1883,6658,4318,3309,3892,6023,6947,7112,4180,7342,929,1193,2666,5193,4571,7282,4506,7343,5834,7095,6630,141,802,5750,7344,4774,7092,4546,2078,5604,7345,7346,5789,4691